  "definitions": "Gray's Anatomy (1918)",
  "geometry": "SynthSeg v1.0 (Apache-2.0, weights shipped IN the SynthSeg repository - the 2.0/robust/parc weights come from a separate link with no licence statement and are NOT used) run on OpenNeuro ds003563, a LIVING subject's 0.6 mm isotropic 7T MPRAGE T1. That dataset declares \"License\": \"CC0\" in its own dataset_description.json - verified there, not assumed from OpenNeuro's default. CC0 places no restriction on use, commercial included, and requires no attribution. Run on a 31 GB VM; it OOMs on an 8 GB laptop.",
  "clearedOn": "2026-08-17"
 },
